    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>section1_description</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"896 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Canadian Exports proudly hosts the largest online database of Canadian manufacturers and exporters. Our mission is to promote Canadian products and services globally by helping Canadian companies connect with international buyers, distributors, and trade partners.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"896 characters\">&lt;p&gt;As the official export promotion platform of Canada, our Canadian Exports Magazine is distributed to over 100,000 verified importers and buyers across more than 120 countries&amp;mdash;making it one of the most widely circulated export-focused publications in the nation.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"896 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Getting started is quick and easy&amp;mdash;&lt;a href=&quot;../en/signup&quot;&gt;online registration&lt;/a&gt; takes just a few minutes.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
