      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"896 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Explore these extensive Business Categories, each featuring reputable and export-ready Canadian companies eager to build lasting partnerships and bring their high-quality products and services to your market.&lt;/p&gt;</span>
